@startuml
!include style.puml

title One scenario table, three runners

rectangle "**Scenario table**\npreconditions, injected fault,\nexpected observable outcome" as ST $storeFill

rectangle "**JVM runner**\nLoopbackTransport + PumpCore\n16 of 19 rows, every push" as JVM $phoneFill
rectangle "**Android instrumented runner**\ntwo physical devices\n19 of 19 rows" as AND $phoneFill
rectangle "**iOS XCTest runner**\nspecified, not built" as IOS $pumpFill

ST --> JVM
ST --> AND
ST --> IOS

note bottom of ST
  No row asserts anything about a platform API.
  That is what lets one table drive all three.
end note

note bottom of IOS
  Marked "spec", never "pass".
  No iOS implementation exists here.
end note

@enduml
